IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ccc-core`
IMPORT `ccc4-s84-definitions`
IMPORT `ccc4-s99-108-trafficking-and-others`

-- ccc4-tests-s99-108.l4 -- tests of ccc4-s99-108-trafficking-and-others.l4 (sections 99 to 108 of the Criminal Code, Canada).
-- Generated by work/gentests.py from work/tests/t_s99_108.py.  Every expected value is written by hand from the text, beside the case, before the run.
-- Abbreviations in the case descriptions: "T" = JUST TRUE, "F" = JUST FALSE, "N" = NOTHING (not covered).
-- The summary-conviction limbs state no penalty and take the answer of section 787(1) as an input: the test passes a stand-in value that is NOT that penalty.

-- A stand-in for the penalty of section 787(1), which is in another part.  It is not that penalty: its figures are arbitrary.
`ccc4 test fixture: a stand-in for section 787(1)` MEANS Punishment WITH
    `mode` IS `on summary conviction`
    `maximum imprisonment` IS `imprisonment for a term of` `six months`
    `minimum imprisonment` IS `no imprisonment is stated`
    `maximum fine` IS `a fine of` 1234
    `minimum fine` IS `no fine is stated`

-- the minimum terms the core lacks
#ASSERT `s 99(2) three years` EQUALS (`Length of time` OF 3, 0, 0, FALSE)   -- "three years": 3 years, no months, no days, not "less a day"
#ASSERT `s 102(2) one year` EQUALS (`Length of time` OF 1, 0, 0, FALSE)   -- "one year": 1 year, no months, no days, not "less a day"

§ `Trafficking Offences`

§§ `Section 99`

-- `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking`
-- inputs, in the order of the GIVEN:
--   1. the kind of thing (`s 84(1) kind of thing`)
--   2. the person manufactures it (BOOLEAN)
--   3. s 84(1) transfer: the person transfers it, whether or not for consideration (MAYBE BOOLEAN)
--   4. the person offers to manufacture or transfer it (BOOLEAN)
--   5. the person knows that the person is not authorized to do so under the Firearms Act or any other Act of Parliament or any regulations made under any Act of Parliament (BOOLEAN)
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a prohibited firearm` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (a) manufactures a prohibited firearm knowing the person is not authorized
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a prohibited firearm` FALSE (JUST TRUE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (a) transfers it, whether or not for consideration
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a prohibited firearm` FALSE (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (b) offers to manufacture or transfer it
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a prohibited firearm` FALSE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- none of manufacturing, transferring or offering
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a prohibited firearm` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- does not know that the person is not authorized
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a prohibited firearm` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the thing is a prohibited firearm
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a restricted firearm` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the thing is a restricted firearm
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a non-restricted firearm` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the thing is a non-restricted firearm
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a prohibited weapon` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the thing is a prohibited weapon
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a restricted weapon` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the thing is a restricted weapon
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a replica firearm` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the thing is a replica firearm
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a prohibited device other than a replica firearm` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the thing is a prohibited device other than a replica firearm
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a firearm part` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the thing is a firearm part
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: ammunition other than prohibited ammunition` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the thing is a ammunition other than prohibited ammunition
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: prohibited ammunition` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the thing is a prohibited ammunition
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a cross-bow` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- a cross-bow is not named
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: an explosive substance` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- a explosive substance is not named
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a thing that is none of those` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- a thing that is none of the classes is not named
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a prohibited firearm` FALSE NOTHING FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- whether the act is a transfer is not covered, and nothing else is done
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a prohibited firearm` TRUE NOTHING FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- whether the act is a transfer is not covered, but the person manufactures it
#ASSERT `s 99(1) the person commits an offence of weapons trafficking` `s 84(1) kind: a prohibited firearm` FALSE NOTHING FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- whether the act is a transfer is not covered, and the person does not know of the lack of authority

-- `s 99(2) the class of the offence`
#ASSERT `s 99(2) the class of the offence` EQUALS `an indictable offence`  -- indictable only

