#ASSERT `s 99(3) the class of the offence` EQUALS `an indictable offence`  -- indictable only

-- `s 99(3) the punishment in any other case`
-- inputs, in the order of the GIVEN:
--   1. the kind of thing the object in question is (`s 84(1) kind of thing`)
#ASSERT `s 99(3) the punishment in any other case` `s 84(1) kind: a prohibited weapon` EQUALS JUST (Punishment WITH `mode` IS `by indictment`, `maximum imprisonment` IS (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), `minimum imprisonment` IS `no imprisonment is stated`, `maximum fine` IS `no fine is stated`, `minimum fine` IS `no fine is stated`)   -- the object is a prohibited weapon: any other case, not more than 14 years and no minimum
#ASSERT `s 99(3) the punishment in any other case` `s 84(1) kind: a restricted weapon` EQUALS JUST (Punishment WITH `mode` IS `by indictment`, `maximum imprisonment` IS (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), `minimum imprisonment` IS `no imprisonment is stated`, `maximum fine` IS `no fine is stated`, `minimum fine` IS `no fine is stated`)   -- the object is a restricted weapon: any other case, not more than 14 years and no minimum
