#ASSERT `s 103(2) the punishment when the object in question is a firearm, device, part or prohibited ammunition` `s 84(1) kind: a replica firearm` TRUE EQUALS JUST (Punishment WITH `mode` IS `by indictment`, `maximum imprisonment` IS (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), `minimum imprisonment` IS (`imprisonment for a term of` `five years`), `maximum fine` IS `no fine is stated`, `minimum fine` IS `no fine is stated`)   -- a second or subsequent offence, the object is a replica firearm: minimum five years
#ASSERT `s 103(2) the punishment when the object in question is a firearm, device, part or prohibited ammunition` `s 84(1) kind: a prohibited device other than a replica firearm` FALSE EQUALS JUST (Punishment WITH `mode` IS `by indictment`, `maximum imprisonment` IS (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), `minimum imprisonment` IS (`imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 3, 0, 0, FALSE)), `maximum fine` IS `no fine is stated`, `minimum fine` IS `no fine is stated`)   -- a first offence, the object is a prohibited device other than a replica firearm: minimum three years
#ASSERT `s 103(2) the punishment when the object in question is a firearm, device, part or prohibited ammunition` `s 84(1) kind: a prohibited device other than a replica firearm` TRUE EQUALS JUST (Punishment WITH `mode` IS `by indictment`, `maximum imprisonment` IS (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), `minimum imprisonment` IS (`imprisonment for a term of` `five years`), `maximum fine` IS `no fine is stated`, `minimum fine` IS `no fine is stated`)   -- a second or subsequent offence, the object is a prohibited device other than a replica firearm: minimum five years
#ASSERT `s 103(2) the punishment when the object in question is a firearm, device, part or prohibited ammunition` `s 84(1) kind: a firearm part` FALSE EQUALS JUST (Punishment WITH `mode` IS `by indictment`, `maximum imprisonment` IS (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), `minimum imprisonment` IS (`imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 3, 0, 0, FALSE)), `maximum fine` IS `no fine is stated`, `minimum fine` IS `no fine is stated`)   -- a first offence, the object is a firearm part: minimum three years
#ASSERT `s 103(2) the punishment when the object in question is a firearm, device, part or prohibited ammunition` `s 84(1) kind: a firearm part` TRUE EQUALS JUST (Punishment WITH `mode` IS `by indictment`, `maximum imprisonment` IS (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`), `minimum imprisonment` IS (`imprisonment for a term of` `five years`), `maximum fine` IS `no fine is stated`, `minimum fine` IS `no fine is stated`)   -- a second or subsequent offence, the object is a firearm part: minimum five years
